      "$value": "env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px)",
      "$description": "Safe-area insets (UI audit §10). The site declares `viewport-fit=cover` plus `black-translucent`, so the viewport extends under the notch and the home indicator — anything pinned to a screen edge must add these or it renders underneath the hardware. Tokenised with a 0px fallback so they are inert on every non-notched device and in headless browsers."
